WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.836
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:01.106 --> 00:03.108
[♪ opening theme song playing]

3
00:42.064 --> 00:48.070
THE PERFECT LIE

4
00:53.158 --> 00:54.743
THIS DRAMA IS A WORK OF FICTION.

5
00:54.826 --> 00:58.080
SCENES INVOLVING CHILD ACTORS AND ANIMALS WERE FILMED SAFELY.

6
00:58.872 --> 01:01.208
[♪ calm music plays]

7
01:04.961 --> 01:11.968
3 MONTHS LATER

8
01:16.932 --> 01:23.063
EPISODE 8 LIAR

9
01:23.146 --> 01:25.148
[♪ ambient music plays]

10
01:36.827 --> 01:40.080
Stop staring at me and eat your food. What am I, a TV?

11
01:40.706 --> 01:45.627
I still can't believe someone so beautiful is sitting right in front of me,

12
01:46.503 --> 01:48.463
let alone that she's my girlfriend.

13
01:50.382 --> 01:52.968
Don't ever get contacts or glasses,

14
01:53.051 --> 01:54.636
or laser eye surgery.

15
01:54.719 --> 01:57.556
I want you to stay this blind to my flaws forever.

16
01:58.140 --> 02:01.268
[Namu] These days, I don't even get hungry when I skip meals

17
02:01.768 --> 02:04.187
or feel tired when I don't sleep.

18
02:16.825 --> 02:17.993
Thank you.

19
02:20.495 --> 02:21.621
Likewise.

20
02:49.900 --> 02:51.193
[Jisun] What kind of flowers are these?

21
02:51.860 --> 02:53.820
Oh, they're gladiolus.

22
02:54.696 --> 02:56.239
"Gladiolus"?

23
02:56.323 --> 02:57.324
Yes.

24
02:57.407 --> 02:58.867
They're beautiful.

25
03:00.869 --> 03:01.870
[Namu] Is that…

26
03:04.164 --> 03:05.499
Is that him?

27
03:07.501 --> 03:08.668
It doesn't matter.

28
03:16.593 --> 03:20.806
I can't believe they dropped the charges, even with photos of him buying GHB.

29
03:23.934 --> 03:25.644
[♪ haunting music plays]

30
03:28.522 --> 03:29.981
Min Junho!

31
03:36.029 --> 03:39.407
[Hwayoung] Min Junho, you're under arrest for violating the Narcotics Control Act.

32
03:51.378 --> 03:52.796
What happened?

33
03:53.797 --> 03:57.175
We've secured evidence that Min Junho purchased GHB and actually received it.

34
03:58.051 --> 03:59.553
He'll be prosecuted.

35
04:05.892 --> 04:07.477
He always finds a way out.

36
04:12.816 --> 04:14.276
No matter how hard we try.

37
04:17.195 --> 04:18.947
-Min Junho always wins. -[♪ heavy music plays]

38
04:19.489 --> 04:20.824
-[Hwayoung] If this… -[captain sighs]

39
04:20.907 --> 04:24.369
If this isn't Min Junho, then who is it?

40
04:26.371 --> 04:31.167
[captain] So basically, they're telling us we have to catch him in the act.

41
04:31.251 --> 04:32.669
[Hwayoung] Damn it.

42
04:37.215 --> 04:38.633
They're not prosecuting him?

43
04:44.514 --> 04:47.642
THE PROSECUTION HEREBY DECIDES NOT TO PROSECUTE AS FOLLOWS

44
04:47.726 --> 04:48.727
[Hwayoung] We'll have to…

45
04:52.272 --> 04:53.815
find another way now.

46
05:01.197 --> 05:03.241
[Namu] I can't imagine how you must feel seeing him

47
05:03.325 --> 05:04.951
walking around like nothing happened.

48
05:07.370 --> 05:08.496
Don't worry about it.

49
05:09.831 --> 05:12.667
I don't want someone like him ruining our date.

50
05:14.878 --> 05:15.962
Let's get out of here.

51
05:17.088 --> 05:19.257
-I'm fine. -Well, I'm not.

52
05:23.720 --> 05:24.721
Come on, let's go.

53
05:48.912 --> 05:50.455
[date] How about a glass of wine tonight?

54
05:51.790 --> 05:52.791
Maybe next time.

55
05:54.501 --> 05:58.546
I don't like letting alcohol make me act on impulse.

56
05:59.798 --> 06:02.133
See, that's what I like about you.

57
06:05.345 --> 06:06.513
Take your pick.

58
06:23.488 --> 06:27.325
Promise you'll call me if anything happens.

59
06:38.378 --> 06:39.587
I'm…

60
06:40.922 --> 06:44.342
not very good at relationships and I'm not much fun, am I?

61
06:51.641 --> 06:53.268
Do you know why I like you, Namu?

62
06:59.858 --> 07:01.693
Because I know what to expect from you.

63
07:05.780 --> 07:07.741
You're the same person through and through.

64
07:10.452 --> 07:13.455
I can tell by the way you treat people.

65
07:13.538 --> 07:14.873
[♪ heartwarming music plays]

66
07:14.956 --> 07:15.999
You're always generous,

67
07:16.082 --> 07:18.168
but you have principles you never compromise on.

68
07:21.963 --> 07:26.301
Even if the passion between us fades someday…

69
07:29.095 --> 07:32.307
I think you'll still treat me with the same kindness.

70
07:38.688 --> 07:42.650
[Namu] You're so full of color, Jisun.

71
07:44.944 --> 07:46.362
You're like…

72
07:46.446 --> 07:51.868
red and green and yellow and purple…

73
07:52.368 --> 07:54.204
[Namu laughs]

74
08:30.114 --> 08:31.658
[Jisun] Have a good trip.

75
08:43.878 --> 08:45.380
[door slides]

76
09:23.251 --> 09:25.003
[♪ uneasy music plays]

77
09:32.302 --> 09:33.428
RECENT SEARCHES MIN JUNHO

78
09:33.511 --> 09:36.139
MIN JUNHO CARDIOVASCULAR AND THORACIC SURGEON

79
09:45.523 --> 09:46.900
TAGGED IN THIS PHOTO

80
09:49.485 --> 09:52.572
YUMYUM PILATES STUDIO SHIN YUMI

81
10:09.589 --> 10:11.507
[♪ ambient music plays]

82
10:14.886 --> 10:18.056
Honestly, I don't even know why I agreed to meet you.

83
10:19.641 --> 10:21.976
He's already told me about you.

84
10:27.273 --> 10:28.524
What did he say?

85
10:28.608 --> 10:30.485
[Yumi] That you put him through a lot.

86
10:36.074 --> 10:40.370
Anyone hearing that would think I was stalking Min Junho.

87
10:41.246 --> 10:42.997
[Yumi] He warned me to be careful too.

88
10:44.165 --> 10:46.292
He said he can't trust women so easily anymore.

89
10:47.252 --> 10:49.254
And he's a sex offender.

90
10:50.964 --> 10:52.173
Ms. Shin Yumi,

91
10:53.007 --> 10:54.717
do you really trust him?

92
10:57.804 --> 10:59.555
Well, why should I believe you?

93
10:59.639 --> 11:02.016
There are two other victims besides me.

94
11:02.600 --> 11:05.603
I just want you to think carefully about who's telling the truth.

95
11:05.687 --> 11:07.522
The three of us or him?

96
11:11.025 --> 11:13.695
He may seem like someone you can trust now,

97
11:14.946 --> 11:18.074
but you never know when he'll drop the act and show his true colors.

98
11:18.157 --> 11:19.826
You don't need to worry about me.

99
11:20.952 --> 11:22.870
[exhales sharply] If anything happens, you can call me--

100
11:22.954 --> 11:24.998
[groans] I see what he meant when he said…

101
11:27.166 --> 11:28.334
you were obsessive.

102
11:45.101 --> 11:46.144
[switch clicks]

103
11:50.940 --> 11:52.233
[switch clicks]

104
11:56.487 --> 11:58.114
[phone vibrating]

105
12:01.993 --> 12:04.871
INCOMING CALL

106
12:15.757 --> 12:16.883
Hello?

107
12:17.467 --> 12:20.720
[Junho] Isn't it a little early for bed?

108
12:21.763 --> 12:23.139
-[♪ sinister music plays] -What is this?

109
12:24.724 --> 12:26.434
[Junho] When you're lying in bed at night,

110
12:27.685 --> 12:29.354
do you ever think about me?

111
12:50.958 --> 12:53.086
-[Jisun] Get lost. -I heard you met with Yumi.

112
12:54.837 --> 12:57.382
How long are you going to keep following me around?

113
12:58.841 --> 13:01.010
I'm never giving up until you're caught.

114
13:01.803 --> 13:02.970
[scoffs]

115
13:03.054 --> 13:04.514
Well, that's just sad.

116
13:04.597 --> 13:05.640
Just you wait.

117
13:06.849 --> 13:10.311
Someday, all the pain you've caused others will come right back to you.

118
13:10.395 --> 13:11.687
[Junho] Remember that night?

119
13:18.611 --> 13:19.695
I enjoyed it.

120
13:23.408 --> 13:24.617
See you again soon.

121
13:25.368 --> 13:26.786
[call disconnects]

122
13:30.706 --> 13:32.667
[car door opens, closes]

123
13:33.501 --> 13:35.378
[car starts]

124
13:51.686 --> 13:54.021
Min Junho called me from outside my house last night.

125
13:55.106 --> 13:56.190
What for?

126
13:56.816 --> 13:59.110
I think he just came to scare me over the phone.

127
14:00.695 --> 14:03.489
I didn't get a wink of sleep, so he got exactly what he wanted.

128
14:03.573 --> 14:04.824
Out of the blue?

129
14:05.783 --> 14:09.078
Well, no. I saw him on a date with another woman,

130
14:09.579 --> 14:11.789
so I met with her and told her about him.

131
14:11.873 --> 14:13.583
-Ms. Kang! -We have to stop anyone else

132
14:13.666 --> 14:15.209
-from becoming a victim. -We will.

133
14:16.127 --> 14:18.129
So stay away from Min Junho from now on.

134
14:19.088 --> 14:21.340
The police are already keeping an eye on him.

135
14:26.137 --> 14:27.597
[Hwayoung sighs]

136
14:35.104 --> 14:36.355
[Jisun] I think…

137
14:38.691 --> 14:40.193
he recorded what he did to me.

138
14:44.864 --> 14:46.240
What makes you think that?

139
14:48.618 --> 14:50.828
He brought up what happened that night, and…

140
14:53.456 --> 14:57.501
he remembered even the smallest details about my bed and bedroom.

141
14:57.585 --> 14:59.295
[♪ dark music plays]

142
14:59.378 --> 15:00.713
[Junho] Remember that night?

143
15:03.007 --> 15:04.926
Your mint-green comforter…

144
15:06.469 --> 15:08.846
and those frilly bedsheets.

145
15:11.849 --> 15:12.850
I enjoyed it.

146
15:15.603 --> 15:18.356
Min Junho is sharp and highly observant.

147
15:18.439 --> 15:20.191
No, the way he spoke, it was clear.

148
15:23.069 --> 15:26.656
He talked about that night as if he were watching it happen.

149
15:32.036 --> 15:35.039
Men like him want to control women and humiliate them.

150
15:35.665 --> 15:37.833
What could be more humiliating than being filmed?

151
15:40.336 --> 15:42.630
We've searched his house, the hospital, and his car.

152
15:42.713 --> 15:45.132
Every one of his devices. We didn't miss a single one.

153
15:45.216 --> 15:47.009
-I know, but-- -[Hwayoung] Ms. Kang.

154
15:49.136 --> 15:50.221
Please…

155
15:53.140 --> 15:54.433
-Don't do anything. -[♪ music grows heavy]

156
16:03.526 --> 16:05.444
I'm asking you this not as a police officer,

157
16:07.113 --> 16:09.198
but as a fellow victim.

158
16:17.373 --> 16:19.667
I'll have a patrol car stationed outside your house.

159
16:20.793 --> 16:25.589
Please look out for Shin Yumi too. The woman that's dating him right now.

160
16:30.052 --> 16:31.178
I will.

161
16:34.765 --> 16:37.226
[people grunting]

162
16:42.231 --> 16:43.232
[person 1 grunts]

163
16:47.737 --> 16:49.071
[person 1 grunts]

164
16:49.780 --> 16:50.823
[person 2 grunts]

165
16:57.038 --> 16:58.247
[panting]

166
17:08.090 --> 17:09.383
[Yumi exclaims]

167
17:10.176 --> 17:11.469
[Yumi] Hello.

168
17:11.552 --> 17:13.346
[Hwayoung] Sorry to drop by unannounced.

169
17:13.429 --> 17:14.513
Not at all.

170
17:14.597 --> 17:16.849
As you can see, I was in the middle of training.

171
17:16.932 --> 17:21.520
Actually, I just spoke with Ms. Kang Jisun, and--

172
17:21.604 --> 17:23.022
Ms. Kang Jisun?

173
17:23.105 --> 17:24.607
I met her yesterday too.

174
17:28.319 --> 17:29.779
She thinks Min Junho

175
17:30.946 --> 17:32.948
may have recorded his crimes.

176
17:37.161 --> 17:39.622
And that he's keeping the recordings somewhere.

177
17:43.876 --> 17:45.127
And…

178
17:45.836 --> 17:47.546
she's worried about you, Inspector.

179
17:50.716 --> 17:51.884
I see.

180
17:52.885 --> 17:54.720
She seemed like a good person.

181
17:57.306 --> 18:00.267
Min Junho showed up outside Ms. Kang's house last night.

182
18:01.102 --> 18:03.771
I think it's because she's been digging into his affairs.

183
18:05.564 --> 18:06.607
I know.

184
18:11.821 --> 18:14.031
Did you tell him about her?

185
18:18.369 --> 18:19.412
Why would you do that?

186
18:20.413 --> 18:22.248
I want him on edge.

187
18:24.083 --> 18:27.628
That's when he'll make mistakes, and that's how we'll catch him.

188
18:29.338 --> 18:32.216
I don't want Ms. Kang getting caught up in this.

189
18:32.299 --> 18:34.677
She chose to get involved.

190
18:35.678 --> 18:38.723
I just used that opportunity to play on Min Junho's anxiety.

191
18:38.806 --> 18:40.516
Why are you provoking him like that?

192
18:41.892 --> 18:44.145
Because he won't leave Kang Jisun alone.

193
18:46.021 --> 18:48.274
What do you think Min Junho is after?

194
18:53.821 --> 18:55.239
[♪ curious music plays]

195
18:55.322 --> 18:56.657
Whatever it is,

196
18:58.159 --> 18:59.952
I'll catch him before he gets the chance.

197
19:01.162 --> 19:02.788
[sighs]

198
19:04.039 --> 19:07.793
Min Junho is not an ordinary sex offender.

199
19:07.877 --> 19:08.878
I know.

200
19:09.378 --> 19:11.005
He's a malignant narcissist.

201
19:11.088 --> 19:12.256
[phone buzzes]

202
19:15.176 --> 19:16.177
[Yumi scoffs softly]

203
19:18.554 --> 19:21.390
[Junho] How about dinner at my place on Sunday?

204
19:22.141 --> 19:24.268
For now, leave Min Junho to me.

205
19:29.732 --> 19:31.025
[Hwayoung] And one more thing…

206
19:32.818 --> 19:34.653
This is a GHB test kit.

207
19:35.404 --> 19:36.906
Keep it with you at all times.

208
19:38.491 --> 19:39.950
Collecting evidence is one thing,

209
19:40.034 --> 19:41.744
but you need to stay safe too.

210
19:43.204 --> 19:44.580
Thank you.

211
19:48.751 --> 19:50.294
[door whirs open]

212
20:03.474 --> 20:06.811
19:07 DEPARTED SANGCHEON HOSPITAL 20:10 ARRIVED HOME

213
20:23.577 --> 20:24.912
[door locks]

214
20:28.707 --> 20:29.792
Honey?

215
20:41.720 --> 20:43.264
[call connects]

216
20:48.519 --> 20:51.647
[automated voice] The call cannot be connected. Please leave a message…

217
21:07.454 --> 21:08.706
[switch clicks]

218
21:13.627 --> 21:14.628
[Hwayoung chuckles softly]

219
21:26.682 --> 21:27.766
[Seokgu] Don't touch that.

220
21:29.435 --> 21:30.686
You were home?

221
21:31.270 --> 21:32.646
[Seokgu] Hey, this…

222
21:32.730 --> 21:34.815
It's sharper than it looks.

223
21:34.899 --> 21:36.859
-[blade snaps shut] -I don't want you getting hurt.

224
21:40.696 --> 21:42.698
-[Hwayoung] Should we… -[Seokgu] Yeah?

225
21:43.741 --> 21:45.492
…order something nice for dinner tonight?

226
21:48.829 --> 21:51.290
Sorry, I have something I need to finish.

227
21:51.999 --> 21:53.292
Go ahead and order something.

228
21:53.959 --> 21:57.963
Chubchubs, keep Mommy company for dinner tonight, okay?

229
21:59.298 --> 22:00.591
See you in a bit.

230
22:07.389 --> 22:09.475
-[♪ foreboding music playing] -[drill whirring]

231
22:11.352 --> 22:13.103
[drill whirring]

232
22:15.230 --> 22:17.107
[person] Enjoying your leave?

233
22:17.191 --> 22:18.192
[Seokgu] Yeah.

234
22:23.447 --> 22:26.158
[person] I thought you were planning to run away

235
22:26.241 --> 22:27.993
when you said you wanted an old yacht.

236
22:29.036 --> 22:32.373
But now it looks like you're heading out to sea to dump a body or something.

237
22:32.456 --> 22:33.791
[Seokgu chuckles]

238
22:38.462 --> 22:40.464
Come by my office. Let's have a glass of soju.

239
22:42.091 --> 22:43.092
[Seokgu] Hey, Muyeong.

240
22:44.510 --> 22:46.762
Can you pretend you don't know anything about this?

241
22:51.350 --> 22:52.518
Hey, what's going on?

242
22:53.519 --> 22:56.271
From this moment on, you don't know me. Got it?

243
23:01.068 --> 23:03.320
[♪ tense music building]

244
23:44.319 --> 23:48.657
-[nurse] Huh? Who put soju in my drink? -[staff 1] It was me.

245
23:48.741 --> 23:50.200
[lively indistinct chatter]

246
23:50.868 --> 23:52.077
[staff 2] How about a toast?

247
23:52.161 --> 23:54.621
-[staff 3] Sounds good. -[staff 2] Cheers!

248
23:54.705 --> 23:57.374
-Good work, team! -Good work, everyone!

249
24:01.420 --> 24:03.297
-[staff 4] Oh, man. I'm stuffed. -[head nurse] Dr. Min!

250
24:04.089 --> 24:05.966
Let's go for round two!

251
24:06.050 --> 24:07.468
[Junho] I've had quite a bit to drink.

252
24:07.551 --> 24:09.011
-How about gopchang? -Oh, no…

253
24:09.094 --> 24:10.888
[staff 4] Let's go! No skipping out!

254
24:10.971 --> 24:12.931
Come on! Let's go!

255
24:13.015 --> 24:15.434
-Let's go, hurry up! -Okay, let's go!

256
24:16.018 --> 24:18.020
[staff] Cheers!

257
24:21.273 --> 24:22.566
Thank you.

258
24:24.860 --> 24:26.320
Cheers.

259
24:42.503 --> 24:43.962
[exhales deeply]

260
24:44.046 --> 24:45.464
[footsteps approaching]

261
24:45.547 --> 24:47.049
[Muyeong] What's this?

262
24:48.050 --> 24:49.468
You said you had a work dinner.

263
24:51.011 --> 24:53.138
Where were you last night? I couldn't reach you.

264
24:54.807 --> 24:56.266
I asked you where you were!

265
24:56.892 --> 24:58.769
DR. MIN JUNHO

266
24:58.852 --> 25:00.979
[Junho] Did you get home okay this morning?

267
25:02.773 --> 25:03.899
[moans softly]

268
25:05.692 --> 25:06.693
Wait, I…

269
25:08.320 --> 25:09.863
I don't remember.

270
25:11.406 --> 25:13.408
[♪ music pulsing]

271
25:28.632 --> 25:30.759
SAFETY, INTEGRITY, TRUST MANAGEMENT OFFICE

272
25:44.982 --> 25:47.234
[nurse] You promised you'd come home today.

273
25:47.317 --> 25:48.402
Today's our wedding anniversary--

274
25:48.485 --> 25:49.945
[Muyeong] You're the one who said that.

275
25:59.079 --> 26:00.497
[rustling]

276
26:09.548 --> 26:11.383
[clattering]

277
26:12.634 --> 26:14.678
[nurse] How did he get out of it?

278
26:18.182 --> 26:22.811
I think that woman Kang Jisun and I went through the same thing.

279
26:23.979 --> 26:25.272
You called her a gold digger.

280
26:27.107 --> 26:28.317
What, so…

281
26:29.234 --> 26:31.195
have you come up with a different excuse?

282
26:36.491 --> 26:39.203
When you talk to me like that, it really makes me want to die.

283
26:39.995 --> 26:41.413
I said I can't remember--

284
26:41.496 --> 26:43.665
Will you please stop lying?

285
26:46.919 --> 26:50.464
Just admit you got drunk with that doctor you had a thing for and made a mistake.

286
26:50.547 --> 26:53.383
At least be honest about it and beg me to forgive you.

287
26:55.928 --> 26:56.929
[sighs]

288
26:57.012 --> 26:59.264
The fact that you're still lying to me like this…

289
27:01.600 --> 27:03.435
It makes me feel even more miserable.

290
27:06.355 --> 27:07.522
[Muyeong sighs]

291
27:26.541 --> 27:30.754
CARDIOVASCULAR CENTER

292
27:40.347 --> 27:42.057
[phone buzzing]

293
27:46.144 --> 27:47.145
[Junho] Yes.

294
27:50.732 --> 27:52.651
Make sure everything goes according to plan.

295
27:54.861 --> 27:57.114
[♪ uneasy music plays]

296
28:07.457 --> 28:08.500
[Jisun gasps]

297
28:09.793 --> 28:12.004
-[Jisun struggling] -[♪ sinister music plays]

298
28:12.879 --> 28:15.882
Hey. Keep it down, will you?

299
28:17.884 --> 28:19.386
[van door closes]

300
28:28.395 --> 28:29.730
[van clunks]

301
28:42.242 --> 28:44.036
[♪ tense music plays]

302
28:44.119 --> 28:46.496
[kidnapper 1 chattering indistinctly]

303
28:47.080 --> 28:49.041
[kidnapper 1 clears throat]

304
28:55.797 --> 28:57.257
[kidnapper 1 clears throat]

305
29:07.225 --> 29:08.477
[kidnapper 1] What the…

306
29:08.560 --> 29:10.604
-Damn it! -[Jisun] No!

307
29:13.148 --> 29:15.150
-[Jisun screams] -[kidnapper 1] You didn't lock the door?

308
29:16.693 --> 29:17.778
[kidnapper 2 grunts]

309
29:17.861 --> 29:18.987
[kidnapper 2 groans]

310
29:19.071 --> 29:20.447
[Jisun grunts]

311
29:20.530 --> 29:22.032
[Jisun screams]

312
29:23.408 --> 29:25.202
[kidnapper 1] What are you doing? Knock her out.

313
29:25.285 --> 29:26.286
[Jisun screams]

314
29:27.245 --> 29:28.705
-[kidnapper 1] Jeez. -[kidnapper 2] Damn it.

315
29:32.042 --> 29:33.043
[Jisun moans]

316
29:44.763 --> 29:46.681
EDEN PSYCHIATRIC HOSPITAL

317
29:49.684 --> 29:51.311
[kidnapper 1] Hey, wake up!

318
29:51.978 --> 29:53.522
She's completely knocked out, huh?

319
29:59.152 --> 30:00.529
[doctor] Ms. Kang Jisun?

320
30:00.612 --> 30:01.863
Is all the paperwork ready?

321
30:01.947 --> 30:03.865
-[kidnapper 1] Oh, of course. Here it is. -[doctor] Okay.

322
30:07.285 --> 30:08.620
[♪ eerie music plays]

323
30:08.703 --> 30:10.705
[doctor] Take her to the high-observation room.

324
30:10.789 --> 30:12.165
-[kidnapper 1] Okay. -[doctor] Go ahead.

325
30:24.177 --> 30:26.388
-[kidnapper 1] What the… -[kidnapper 2] What the hell?

326
30:26.471 --> 30:27.556
[kidnapper 1] What's wrong with this?

327
30:27.639 --> 30:29.099
[kidnapper 2] What's going on with this thing?

328
30:29.182 --> 30:30.433
[button clicking]

329
30:31.768 --> 30:32.811
[kidnapper 1] It's not working?

330
30:32.894 --> 30:34.354
[kidnapper 2] Damn it, the doors won't close.

331
30:34.437 --> 30:36.648
-[kidnapper 1] What's wrong? -[kidnapper 2] Hello?

332
30:38.358 --> 30:39.359
It's not working.

333
30:39.442 --> 30:40.902
[kidnapper 1] Jeez, what's wrong with this?

334
30:41.403 --> 30:43.029
-Hello? -[kidnapper 1] What the…

335
30:43.905 --> 30:46.032
-[kidnapper 1 screams] -[kidnapper 2] Hey, what's wrong?

336
30:46.116 --> 30:47.450
-[Jisun screams] -[♪ tense music plays]

337
30:47.534 --> 30:48.743
-[kidnapper 2] Damn it! -[Jisun screams]

338
30:50.287 --> 30:51.997
[Jisun struggling]

339
30:53.707 --> 30:54.708
[groaning painfully]

340
30:57.043 --> 30:59.421
[kidnapper 2 groaning]

341
31:01.590 --> 31:03.133
[kidnapper 1 groans] Damn it!

342
31:04.384 --> 31:05.594
[kicking forcefully]

343
31:05.677 --> 31:07.095
-[kidnapper 1 screaming] -[Jisun] Let go!

344
31:09.806 --> 31:11.558
[kidnappers groaning]

345
31:12.976 --> 31:14.978
MEDICAL SCHOOL FACULTY ASSOCIATION

346
31:15.061 --> 31:17.063
MAY YOUR VISION REACH FAR AND WIDE

347
31:23.612 --> 31:24.863
FROM ALL THE STAFF

348
31:24.946 --> 31:26.948
[♪ soft music plays]

349
31:31.786 --> 31:35.332
CENTER DIRECTOR MIN JUNHO

350
31:44.049 --> 31:45.342
[Junho sighs]

351
31:45.425 --> 31:47.219
[phone buzzing]

352
31:52.891 --> 31:54.100
[Junho] Yes?

353
31:58.980 --> 32:00.315
She couldn't have gotten far.

354
32:02.609 --> 32:07.155
You do realize you'll be held responsible if anything goes wrong, don't you?

355
32:10.408 --> 32:12.202
If you don't want to regret this later,

356
32:12.702 --> 32:17.540
do whatever it takes to find her, and make sure she's locked away for good.

357
32:23.880 --> 32:25.548
-[door lock beeps] -[Jisun] Park Junghyeon.

358
32:28.969 --> 32:30.720
-Hey. -[exclaims]

359
32:34.057 --> 32:36.393
Hey, what… What are you doing here?

360
32:38.728 --> 32:39.854
Are you okay?

361
32:40.355 --> 32:41.773
[PA chime sounds]

362
32:41.856 --> 32:42.941
[announcement over PA] Code blue.

363
32:43.024 --> 32:45.110
Emergency Department, traffic accident patient.

364
32:57.789 --> 32:59.708
[♪ uneasy music plays]

365
33:11.928 --> 33:14.347
Do you think I need to be institutionalized?

366
33:17.183 --> 33:18.184
No.

367
33:20.979 --> 33:22.439
Can I really trust you?

368
33:41.249 --> 33:42.250
[error tone]

369
33:44.461 --> 33:45.628
[error tone]

370
33:45.712 --> 33:46.880
Damn it.

371
33:50.091 --> 33:51.134
[locker door unlocks]

372
34:00.018 --> 34:01.519
[clattering]

373
34:14.115 --> 34:15.408
Why won't it turn off?

374
34:30.090 --> 34:31.883
[locker door lock beeping]

375
34:47.816 --> 34:52.070
[agent] The last known location where Mr. Min Junho's lost phone was turned on

376
34:52.862 --> 34:56.199
matches the location of the phone you're calling from.

377
34:57.784 --> 34:58.785
Here?

378
35:01.955 --> 35:03.206
Okay.

379
35:05.125 --> 35:06.251
[call disconnects]

380
35:06.334 --> 35:08.044
-Thanks. -[doctor] No problem.

381
35:10.714 --> 35:12.716
-[sighs] -[door opens, closes]

382
35:18.096 --> 35:19.097
Thanks.

383
35:21.391 --> 35:23.393
No, thanks for letting me help.

384
35:26.563 --> 35:27.772
I should get going.

385
35:27.856 --> 35:29.274
[Junghyeon] I'm getting out of here.

386
35:31.693 --> 35:34.320
My cousin started a start-up, and apparently it's taken off.

387
35:34.404 --> 35:36.489
I'm thinking of joining him to learn the ropes.

388
35:46.833 --> 35:48.585
So you're the one leaving, not me.

389
35:49.919 --> 35:51.254
[Junghyeon chuckles dryly]

390
35:51.337 --> 35:52.839
Well, I only have myself to blame.

391
35:54.507 --> 35:55.967
But what are you going to do with that?

392
35:59.053 --> 36:01.514
Whatever you're planning, let me help you one more time.

393
36:06.519 --> 36:07.937
I think he might have…

394
36:12.150 --> 36:13.818
filmed what he did to me that night.

395
36:26.206 --> 36:27.499
[cabinet door opens]

396
36:28.792 --> 36:29.959
[clattering]

397
36:30.043 --> 36:31.252
[clang]

398
36:32.420 --> 36:33.505
[bottle opens]

399
36:40.720 --> 36:41.805
[doorbell rings]

400
36:44.015 --> 36:45.433
[Junho] You're on time.

401
36:47.352 --> 36:48.353
Hey.

402
36:49.854 --> 36:50.939
Here.

403
36:51.022 --> 36:52.232
What's this?

404
36:52.315 --> 36:54.108
I didn't want to come empty-handed.

405
36:55.109 --> 36:57.445
Blue roses symbolize miracles.

406
36:58.154 --> 36:59.447
[Yumi hums]

407
36:59.531 --> 37:01.574
I just thought they suited you.

408
37:02.700 --> 37:06.246
So tonight, how about we have a nice dinner and some wine?

409
37:07.997 --> 37:10.542
Is there some special occasion I don't know about?

410
37:12.627 --> 37:15.296
Stay in the living room. I'll get you a glass of wine.

411
37:37.026 --> 37:38.778
[wine pouring]

412
37:44.117 --> 37:45.368
I love this painting.

413
37:46.995 --> 37:48.913
It's an original. The only one in the world.

414
37:50.540 --> 37:51.958
Who's the artist?

415
37:52.959 --> 37:54.419
My mother.

416
37:54.502 --> 37:55.587
[Yumi gasps softly]

417
37:55.670 --> 37:59.841
[Yumi] Wow, I don't know the first thing about art, but it's beautiful.

418
38:02.552 --> 38:03.720
Cheers.

419
38:04.554 --> 38:06.598
[♪ insidious music plays]

420
38:18.651 --> 38:19.736
Wait.

421
38:21.821 --> 38:23.114
I was thirsty on my way here,

422
38:23.197 --> 38:25.325
so I think this wine will go straight to my head.

423
38:27.118 --> 38:28.369
Can I have a glass of water?

424
38:31.372 --> 38:32.832
Sure, I'll get you one.

425
38:33.374 --> 38:34.834
[glass thuds softly]

426
38:59.817 --> 39:01.402
[coughing]

427
39:03.905 --> 39:05.198
[Junho] Are you okay?

428
39:05.281 --> 39:06.741
-Thanks. -[Junho] Yeah.

429
39:09.661 --> 39:11.371
[phone buzzing]

430
39:13.831 --> 39:15.083
-Hang on. -Yeah.

431
39:16.209 --> 39:17.460
[Yumi] Hey, Mom. What's up?

432
39:19.087 --> 39:20.088
What?

433
39:21.923 --> 39:23.341
Okay, I'll be right there.

434
39:25.426 --> 39:26.427
[call disconnects]

435
39:27.971 --> 39:29.013
Is something wrong?

436
39:29.097 --> 39:31.349
My mom's dog went missing.

437
39:32.558 --> 39:33.726
I have to go.

438
39:35.103 --> 39:36.104
Oh, yeah.

439
39:36.187 --> 39:37.355
You'd better hurry.

440
39:38.064 --> 39:39.065
I'm sorry, Junho.

441
39:40.233 --> 39:41.484
No, it's okay.

442
39:59.544 --> 40:00.628
[rustling]

443
40:00.712 --> 40:01.796
Yes!

444
40:03.673 --> 40:05.091
[♪ music stops]

445
40:05.800 --> 40:06.968
[Junho] If that had happened,

446
40:08.219 --> 40:09.470
you would've succeeded.

447
40:10.763 --> 40:12.348
[water pouring]

448
40:21.149 --> 40:23.192
[♪ dark music plays]

449
40:30.241 --> 40:31.868
[coughing]

450
40:34.328 --> 40:35.621
[Junho] Are you okay?

451
40:35.705 --> 40:37.290
-Thanks. -[Junho] Yeah.

452
40:40.793 --> 40:42.670
Nice purse.

453
40:45.256 --> 40:46.758
-Mind if I take a look? -[phone buzzing]

454
40:48.468 --> 40:49.635
Hang on.

455
40:54.891 --> 40:56.559
I guess it was a wrong number.

456
40:58.227 --> 40:59.479
I saw everything.

457
41:03.775 --> 41:05.610
-What are you talking about-- -So now…

458
41:07.278 --> 41:09.781
you'll make up some excuse about having to leave, right?

459
41:11.866 --> 41:14.118
Maybe you'll get another urgent phone call.

460
41:14.202 --> 41:15.995
[phone buzzing]

461
41:16.079 --> 41:21.167
Then you'll take that sample and have it tested.

462
41:24.295 --> 41:26.380
And the police waiting outside might even be

463
41:27.048 --> 41:29.383
-listening to this conversation right now. -Damn it.

464
41:36.140 --> 41:37.725
[♪ sinister music plays]

465
41:38.226 --> 41:40.978
Did I get that about right, Ms. Shin Yumi?

466
41:49.862 --> 41:50.863
[Yumi sighs]

467
41:51.739 --> 41:53.074
[Yumi exhales deeply]

468
42:19.475 --> 42:21.018
[Junho scoffs]

469
42:25.940 --> 42:27.191
[detective] The captain's here.

470
42:30.611 --> 42:32.238
[exhales sharply]

471
42:44.000 --> 42:45.251
[Jisun] I think he might have…

472
42:47.378 --> 42:49.005
filmed what he did to me that night.

473
42:51.924 --> 42:53.759
Should I just kill that bastard?

474
42:55.178 --> 42:57.847
I thought maybe I could find something on it.

475
42:58.431 --> 43:00.266
Hey, wait. What are you doing?

476
43:00.349 --> 43:02.351
If you turn it on, they can track it.

477
43:03.186 --> 43:06.022
It's probably locked, and I'm sure he's already reported it lost.

478
43:07.106 --> 43:09.150
I'll have an expert take a look at it.

479
43:11.319 --> 43:12.653
An expert? Who?

480
43:13.529 --> 43:14.864
[Junghyeon] Well, you don't need to know.

481
43:16.199 --> 43:18.075
[chopsticks clattering]

482
43:25.249 --> 43:26.626
Here, have some while you work.

483
43:26.709 --> 43:27.710
I unlocked it.

484
43:28.544 --> 43:29.545
You did?

485
43:30.421 --> 43:31.505
Damn…

486
43:33.591 --> 43:35.134
[phone rings]

487
43:37.511 --> 43:38.512
Hello?

488
43:40.348 --> 43:42.808
-A caregiver? -[Junghyeon] Yeah. [inhales sharply]

489
43:42.892 --> 43:46.145
This might be nothing, but there are some text messages here.

490
43:46.729 --> 43:48.731
I'll take a picture and send it to you. Hang on.

491
43:50.983 --> 43:52.235
[phone chimes]

492
43:57.657 --> 44:00.368
[caregiver] When are you coming to drop off the materials for safekeeping?

493
44:01.994 --> 44:03.246
Where is he supposed to go?

494
44:03.746 --> 44:06.374
[Junghyeon] These messages are from a few days before he was arrested.

495
44:06.457 --> 44:07.458
Wait.

496
44:08.376 --> 44:09.794
His mother's still alive.

497
44:10.586 --> 44:12.088
This could be her caregiver.

498
44:12.797 --> 44:14.298
Oh, really? Hang on.

499
44:14.382 --> 44:17.802
Let me check the app and see if there's an address.

500
44:18.886 --> 44:21.472
Yeah, there's an address. I'll send it to you.

501
44:21.555 --> 44:23.099
MOTHER'S HOUSE 7 GAOK-RO, SANGCHEON

502
44:23.182 --> 44:24.183
[phone chimes]

503
44:28.729 --> 44:29.730
Got it.

504
44:31.023 --> 44:32.024
What about this phone?

505
44:33.317 --> 44:34.402
Just throw it away.

506
44:34.485 --> 44:36.570
I'll get rid of your prepaid phone later too.

507
44:37.905 --> 44:39.407
Thanks for your car too.

508
44:39.991 --> 44:41.242
Sure. Be careful.

509
44:44.578 --> 44:45.746
[call disconnects]

510
44:50.042 --> 44:52.503
[phone buzzing]

511
44:52.586 --> 44:53.629
Yeah, what is it now?

512
44:53.713 --> 44:56.674
Send that caregiver a text from Min Junho's phone.

513
44:56.757 --> 44:59.302
Tell her his assistant is coming to pick up the materials.

514
45:16.110 --> 45:17.361
[clang]

515
45:34.670 --> 45:36.088
[doorbell rings]

516
45:36.630 --> 45:38.215
[caregiver] Who is it?

517
45:38.299 --> 45:39.300
[Jisun] Oh, hi.

518
45:39.383 --> 45:43.471
I'm Dr. Min Junho's assistant.

519
45:52.438 --> 45:53.647
-Thank you. -[caregiver chuckles softly]

520
45:56.525 --> 45:58.110
You should stay for dinner.

521
45:59.403 --> 46:02.031
No, I really have to get going.

522
46:02.114 --> 46:04.867
But we've never had a friend of Dr. Min's visit before,

523
46:04.950 --> 46:06.827
so our chef is already preparing something.

524
46:06.911 --> 46:09.205
He's excited to be making something different

525
46:09.288 --> 46:11.457
than the special meals for his mother.

526
46:13.584 --> 46:15.586
Where is his mother?

527
46:16.170 --> 46:20.007
She doesn't like strangers seeing her in her condition.

528
46:20.800 --> 46:24.804
But she was so happy when she heard Dr. Min's girlfriend was coming today.

529
46:25.388 --> 46:26.555
Girlfriend?

530
46:27.473 --> 46:29.266
No, I'm not his girlfriend.

531
46:29.350 --> 46:31.769
I'm his research assistant. I help him with his papers.

532
46:32.645 --> 46:36.232
[caregiver] Dr. Min sent a message asking us to take especially good care of you.

533
46:36.816 --> 46:40.069
[Junghyeon] My dear girlfriend will be coming to pick up some materials.

534
46:40.152 --> 46:42.655
Please take good care of her.

535
46:45.324 --> 46:47.159
[caregiver] Did you meet at the hospital?

536
46:48.327 --> 46:49.787
Oh, Dr. Min…

537
46:51.414 --> 46:56.836
By the way, where are the materials Dr. Min keeps here?

538
46:58.796 --> 47:01.966
Oh, didn't he tell you?

539
47:05.094 --> 47:08.180
No, he had to rush off for surgery, so…

540
47:12.017 --> 47:13.936
[chuckles awkwardly] Just a moment.

541
47:33.164 --> 47:35.249
[line ringing]

542
47:35.332 --> 47:36.792
Could I use the bathroom?

543
47:48.804 --> 47:50.681
[♪ suspenseful music plays]

544
48:31.013 --> 48:32.014
Oh, my gosh!

545
48:38.521 --> 48:39.688
Hello.

546
48:45.277 --> 48:46.737
Oh, there you are.

547
48:47.279 --> 48:49.615
The food's almost ready.

548
48:51.242 --> 48:53.244
Did you find the materials?

549
48:54.161 --> 48:56.163
Oh, well…

550
48:57.581 --> 48:58.666
[thud]

551
49:00.543 --> 49:02.920
Oh, ma'am, there you are.

552
49:03.003 --> 49:04.713
[thudding]

553
49:04.797 --> 49:05.839
What's wrong?

554
49:06.632 --> 49:08.717
-Oh, my goodness. -[Jisun] Are you okay?

555
49:08.801 --> 49:11.637
-[caregiver] Oh, my back. Butler! -[Mother breathing heavily]

556
49:11.720 --> 49:14.390
[caregiver] Gosh, what do we do? Butler!

557
49:15.474 --> 49:17.560
-We need to help her up. -[♪ inquisitive music plays]

558
49:18.435 --> 49:19.728
-Oh, dear. -[butler] Oh, my goodness!

559
49:19.812 --> 49:21.855
-What on earth happened? -[caregiver grunts]

560
49:21.939 --> 49:22.940
[butler] Oh, dear.

561
49:23.649 --> 49:25.985
[caregiver] Oh, dear.

562
49:26.068 --> 49:28.028
Is she okay? Gosh.

563
50:02.521 --> 50:03.731
[door clicks]

564
50:13.407 --> 50:14.491
[Junho] Sorry I'm late.

565
50:14.575 --> 50:16.035
This is our new center director.

566
50:16.118 --> 50:17.786
And this is Chairman Kim.

567
50:17.870 --> 50:19.955
[Junho] Oh, I've heard so much about you.

568
50:20.039 --> 50:21.332
-Congratulations. -Thank you.

569
50:21.415 --> 50:22.416
[Chairman Kim] Congratulations.

570
50:22.499 --> 50:23.834
GRAND OPENING

571
50:23.917 --> 50:26.003
-[♪ elegant music plays] -[director] Looking sharp today.

572
50:26.545 --> 50:28.464
[Junho] You're looking pretty sharp yourself, sir.

573
50:28.547 --> 50:30.090
[director] Oh, come on.

574
50:30.174 --> 50:31.884
Wow, this center is huge.

575
50:31.967 --> 50:32.968
Dr. Min.

576
50:34.136 --> 50:35.137
-Yes. -[director] Yeah.

577
50:35.220 --> 50:37.306
[nurse] We got a call from your mother's caregiver.

578
50:37.389 --> 50:39.642
She said someone came to visit your mother's house.

579
50:52.529 --> 50:54.865
[♪ unsettling music plays]

580
51:10.297 --> 51:11.423
What the?

581
51:35.239 --> 51:36.240
-[nurse] Dr. Min! -Dr. Min!

582
51:36.323 --> 51:38.242
-Hey, Dr. Min! -[nurse] Where are you going?

583
51:38.325 --> 51:39.410
[guest] Isn't that the director?

584
52:03.100 --> 52:04.518
[car honking]

585
52:04.601 --> 52:06.270
[♪ dire music plays]

586
52:08.105 --> 52:11.567
[Junho] Don't let that woman leave with anything.

587
52:13.527 --> 52:18.198
Under no circumstances are you to let her leave the house until I get there.

588
52:23.620 --> 52:25.247
[Jisun strains]

589
53:18.592 --> 53:19.676
[caregiver] Butler!

590
53:19.760 --> 53:22.221
-Have you seen that woman from earlier? -[butler] No, I haven't.

591
53:22.304 --> 53:23.847
[caregiver] Oh, no. Please find her, quick!

592
53:23.931 --> 53:26.266
[butler] Huh? What's going on now?

593
53:48.872 --> 53:50.249
[clattering]

594
53:53.126 --> 53:54.711
[Jisun exhales sharply]

595
53:55.546 --> 53:57.297
[footsteps approaching]

596
54:06.515 --> 54:07.933
[caregiver] Have you seen that woman?

597
54:08.016 --> 54:09.017
[aide] No, I haven't.

598
54:09.101 --> 54:11.186
[caregiver] My gosh, where did she go?

599
54:14.356 --> 54:16.358
[footsteps receding]

600
55:22.424 --> 55:24.092
[dull clicking]

601
55:36.980 --> 55:38.190
[dull clicking]

602
55:39.775 --> 55:41.151
-[♪ dark music plays] -Damn it…

603
55:43.945 --> 55:46.031
Damn it!

604
55:46.114 --> 55:47.741
[♪ music intensifies]

605
56:04.966 --> 56:05.967
Mom…

606
56:08.512 --> 56:09.721
[Jisun] Damn it.

607
56:10.305 --> 56:11.598
[clunk]

608
56:13.517 --> 56:14.726
[clunking]

609
56:16.061 --> 56:17.270
[clunking in distance]

610
56:19.564 --> 56:21.024
[Mother sobbing, muffled]

611
56:35.539 --> 56:36.540
No!

612
57:00.188 --> 57:01.440
Damn it!

613
57:08.280 --> 57:09.990
[Junho] Kang Jisun, get out!

614
57:10.991 --> 57:13.285
Stop!

615
57:20.834 --> 57:22.961
[breathing shakily]

616
58:00.248 --> 58:01.583
[buzz]

617
58:12.135 --> 58:13.136
[chimes]

618
58:13.678 --> 58:15.806
USB DRIVE 1

619
58:33.031 --> 58:36.868
03.19, APRIL 27 04.16, APRIL 27

620
58:36.952 --> 58:37.953
H001.MP4 APRIL 27

621
58:40.747 --> 58:42.415
[thunderclap]

622
58:42.499 --> 58:44.376
[rain pattering]

623
59:24.207 --> 59:26.293
[♪ gentle music plays]

624
59:30.964 --> 59:32.048
[door opens]

625
59:32.883 --> 59:34.551
[footsteps approaching]

626
59:36.177 --> 59:37.345
[sighs softly]

627
59:44.436 --> 59:46.313
-Oh, sorry. -Hello.

628
59:46.396 --> 59:50.650
[captain] Well, I'm off duty, and gosh, what's with all this rain…

629
59:50.734 --> 59:52.944
I called Detective Lee, but she's not answering.

630
59:53.028 --> 59:54.696
I've found such important evidence.

631
59:54.779 --> 59:56.114
[captain] Oh, the videos…

632
59:57.741 --> 59:58.909
Yes, I heard.

633
01:00:05.290 --> 01:00:07.208
I couldn't bring myself to watch them, but…

634
01:00:08.543 --> 01:00:10.003
there are recordings of me,

635
01:00:10.086 --> 01:00:11.254
Detective Lee…

636
01:00:12.088 --> 01:00:13.590
At least six people in total.

637
01:00:14.507 --> 01:00:15.675
Nine.

638
01:00:17.844 --> 01:00:20.430
According to the tech team, there are nine victims.

639
01:00:24.559 --> 01:00:28.396
And they've confirmed beyond any doubt that it's Min Junho.

640
01:00:29.439 --> 01:00:32.359
Ms. Kang, this time,

641
01:00:32.984 --> 01:00:34.819
Min Junho is definitely going to prison.

642
01:00:36.446 --> 01:00:37.697
For a very long time.

643
01:00:46.206 --> 01:00:47.707
That's what you said last time too.

644
01:00:48.708 --> 01:00:50.210
The evidence is overwhelming.

645
01:00:50.919 --> 01:00:53.838
Our team is heading out to arrest him right now.

646
01:00:53.922 --> 01:00:55.548
[siren blaring]

647
01:01:10.188 --> 01:01:11.272
So it's…

648
01:01:13.024 --> 01:01:14.275
really over now.

649
01:01:15.318 --> 01:01:16.403
[captain] Yes.

650
01:01:46.141 --> 01:01:47.642
[exclaims softly]

651
01:02:44.074 --> 01:02:45.992
[♪ uneasy music plays]

652
01:02:47.786 --> 01:02:52.082
[news anchor on TV] Min Junho, suspected of drugging and sexually assaulting

653
01:02:52.165 --> 01:02:53.792
at least nine people,

654
01:02:53.875 --> 01:02:55.960
has been missing since yesterday.

655
01:02:56.503 --> 01:02:59.005
Min was already under investigation in connection

656
01:02:59.089 --> 01:03:01.800
with two sexual assault cases.

657
01:03:02.425 --> 01:03:05.386
Police stepped up their investigation

658
01:03:05.470 --> 01:03:08.890
after confirming that he had also sexually assaulted the case detective.

659
01:03:08.973 --> 01:03:12.227
However, due to insufficient evidence and because he was not considered

660
01:03:12.310 --> 01:03:16.147
a flight risk, he was allowed to remain free while under investigation.

661
01:03:16.231 --> 01:03:19.818
And he has disappeared after leaving his home last night.

662
01:03:19.901 --> 01:03:22.737
But yesterday evening, police obtained illegally recorded footage

663
01:03:22.821 --> 01:03:26.658
showing at least seven additional victims of sexual assault,

664
01:03:26.741 --> 01:03:31.538
on top of the two cases already under investigation.

665
01:03:31.621 --> 01:03:36.251
Police have now issued a public wanted notice for Min Junho,

666
01:03:36.334 --> 01:03:39.504
who is suspected of nine sexual assaults, and are tracking his movements.

667
01:03:40.130 --> 01:03:44.300
Police say he is 183 cm tall and weighs 73 kg…

668
01:04:33.057 --> 01:04:35.351
[♪ haunting music plays]

669
01:04:38.688 --> 01:04:42.609
THE PERFECT LIE

670
01:04:43.109 --> 01:04:45.486
SPECIAL THANKS TO JO HYE-JOO

671
01:05:12.096 --> 01:05:13.306
[Namu] Min Junho…

672
01:05:14.599 --> 01:05:16.893
-[camera shutter clicks] -I thought he took his own life.

673
01:05:17.602 --> 01:05:19.145
[person 1] It isn't over until it's over.

674
01:05:20.104 --> 01:05:22.482
[Jisun] There were plenty of people who wanted Min Junho dead.

675
01:05:22.565 --> 01:05:24.192
[person 1] While on the run from the police…

676
01:05:24.275 --> 01:05:25.276
[Jieun exhales sharply] No way.

677
01:05:25.360 --> 01:05:27.111
You know nothing, okay?

678
01:05:27.195 --> 01:05:29.155
You know what he did, don't you?

679
01:05:29.239 --> 01:05:30.240
Does that matter?

680
01:05:30.323 --> 01:05:32.242
[person 2] Didn't you let him get away on purpose?

681
01:05:32.325 --> 01:05:33.576
[Jisun struggling]

682
01:05:34.202 --> 01:05:37.121
[person 3] Who killed Min Junho?

683
01:05:37.205 --> 01:05:39.249
[Jisun] The one who drove him to his death…

684
01:05:39.832 --> 01:05:41.334
was Min Junho himself.

685
01:05:48.049 --> 01:05:49.550
[♪ unsettling music plays]

686
01:05:58.559 --> 01:05:59.894
THE PERFECT LIE

687
01:05:59.978 --> 01:06:01.980
Translated by Liya Hyunjoo Choi
